# Main report + dated archive (public verification)

## Where reports live (not inside the e2e harness)

```
AGENT LIBRARY/Reports/
  MAIN_REPORT.html              ← always latest (overwrite)
  archive/
    YYYY-MM-DD_HHMMSS_*.html    ← one dated file per update
  README.md
```

Public Pages sync (for boss):

```
docs/gptfy-agent-skills-e2e/index.html
docs/gptfy-agent-skills-e2e/archive/
```

Harness code stays in `api-skill-e2e-tests/` only (scripts, package, config). Do **not** write reports back under `api-skill-e2e-tests/reports/`.

## After any skill/handler change

1. Deploy + retest every skill on that handler
2. Write **Request + Response** detail (no scoreboard dumps)
3. Overwrite `Reports/MAIN_REPORT.html`
4. Add `Reports/archive/<timestamp>_….html`
5. Tell user both paths + public Pages URL when pushed

## Commands

```bash
cd "AGENT LIBRARY/api-skill-e2e-tests/scripts"
python build_main_report.py
python regression_handler.py CaseAgenticSkillsHandler --reason "Why this change"
```
